## Configuration Structure

The shared configuration follows this structure:

```json
{
  "environments": {
    "dev": {
      "content": {
        "include_patterns": ["*.md", "*.pdf", ...],
        "exclude_patterns": ["*.tmp", "*.log", ...],
        "directories": ["decisions", "foundation", ...]
      },
      "navigation": {
        "directories": [...],
        "include_file_patterns": [...],
        "exclude_file_patterns": [...],
        "title_case_corrections": {
          "ea": "EA",
          "api": "API",
          ...
        }
      },
      "processing_config": {
        "chunk_size": 800,
        "chunk_overlap": 150,
        ...
      },
      "rag_specific": {
        "index_metadata": true,
        "include_debug_info": true,
        ...
      }
    }
  }
}
```
